{"text": "As Farquhar fell straight down between the timbers of the bridge, he lost consciousness and seemed to be already dead. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was awakened by a sharp pain in his throat, and then he felt as if he could not breathe at all. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Suddenly the rope broke, and he fell into the stream with a loud splash, the cold water closing over his head. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Deep under the water he fought to free his hands, and at last the cord around his wrists gave way. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He tore the rope from his neck and rose to the surface, where he took a deep breath of the sweet air. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Never before had his senses been so sharp, for he could see every leaf on the trees and even the tiny insects on them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Looking back, he saw the bridge, the fort, and the soldiers, who were pointing at him and shouting. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The captain gave orders in a calm, slow voice, and the guards began to fire their rifles at the man in the water. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Bullets struck the water all around him, so he dived as deep as he could and swam hard with the current.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "s", " ", "F", "a", "r", "q", "u", "h", "a", "r", " ", "f", "e", "l", "l", " ", "s", "t", "r", "a", "i", "g", "h", "t", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "b", "e", "t", "w", "e", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "t", "i", "m", "b", "e", "r", "s", " ", "o", "f", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "r", "i", "d", "g", "e", ",", " ", "h", "e", " ", "l", "o", "s", "t", " ", "c", "o", "n", "s", "c", "i", "o", "u", "s", "n", "e", "s", "s", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "s", "e", "e", "m", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "b", "e", " ", "a", "l", "r", "e", "a", "d", "y", " ", "d", "e", "a", "d", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", "w", "a", "k", "e", "n", "e", "d", " ", "b", "y", " 